From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kierandrewett <kieran@drewett.dev>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 21:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] mutter: link gdk-pixbuf into gnoblin for background images

Mutter 51 no longer carries a background image loader. The Gnoblin compositor
plugin paints compositor.background under every client so the first frame
after a modeset is the session's wallpaper, not black; it decodes that image
with gdk-pixbuf, which every Gnoblin host already has through GTK.

---
diff --git a/src/meson.build b/src/meson.build
index 558f6e65d..2c334e8d3 100644
--- a/src/meson.build
+++ b/src/meson.build
@@ -1293,6 +1293,9 @@ if not gnoblin_lua_dep.found()
   error('Gnoblin requires Lua 5.4 development files')
 endif
 gnoblin_json_dep = dependency('json-glib-1.0')
+# The compositor plugin decodes compositor.background images itself: Mutter
+# no longer ships a background image loader.
+gnoblin_pixbuf_dep = dependency('gdk-pixbuf-2.0')
 
 gnoblin_api_header = gnoblin_fs.read(gnoblin_root / 'src/control/gnoblin-native-control.h')
 gnoblin_api_major = ''
@@ -1402,7 +1405,7 @@ gnoblin = executable('gnoblin',
     '-DGNOBLIN_NATIVE_CONTROL_API_MINOR=' + gnoblin_api_minor,
     '-DGNOBLIN_DEFAULT_COMPOSITOR="' + gnoblin_prefix / 'bin/gnoblin' + '"',
   ],
-  dependencies: [libmutter_dep, mutter_deps, gnoblin_lua_dep, gnoblin_json_dep],
+  dependencies: [libmutter_dep, mutter_deps, gnoblin_lua_dep, gnoblin_json_dep, gnoblin_pixbuf_dep],
   install_rpath: '$ORIGIN/../' + get_option('libdir') + ':$ORIGIN/../' + get_option('libdir') / 'mutter-51',
   install_dir: bindir,
   install: true,
